{"id":"6bcdecbdd77201ee","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space.md","title":"ZFC Measure5 Measure On Space","display":"df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space — ZFC Measure5 Measure On Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space"],"display":"df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space — ZFC Measure5 Measure On Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-measurable-space]]","[[58-df-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space — ZFC Measure5 Measure On Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"58-df-measurable-space\">58-df-measurable-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"58-df-measurable-space\">58-df-measurable-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}measure\\text{-}on\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}measure\\text{-}on\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The countable-additivity and function clauses are inherited verbatim from the canonical measure predicate; this numbered predicate records that the measure is taken on the specified measurable space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measurable-space","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embe